WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:06.200
This video shows how to assign inventory items to staff and take them back, on a phone.

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:18.259
Tap the menu button, open Inventory and choose Assignments. Each card shows an item, the person who holds it, the quantity and the date it was assigned.

00:00:31.727 --> 00:00:34.967
Tap Assign Item at the top of the page.

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:51.588
Choose the item and the person. Enter the quantity, then type a note, such as a serial number or the purpose.

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:14.746
Tap Assign. A message confirms it, and a new card with your note appears at the top of the list.

00:01:22.976 --> 00:01:35.912
When an item comes back, tap Mark Returned on its card. Choose its condition, such as Fair, and tap Confirm Return. A message confirms it, and the card leaves the Active list.

00:01:51.469 --> 00:02:00.493
Tap the Returned tab. The card is there with its return date and condition. You can also search by person or item.

00:02:09.184 --> 00:02:15.136
You can always see who holds which item, and every assignment and return updates the stock.
